<title>SOUTH KOREA: South Korea's August PPI rises 2.3 pct.</title>
<headline>South Korea's August PPI rises 2.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's producer price index (PPI) rose 2.3 percent in August on the year, down from a 4.6 percent year-on-year rise a year earlier, Ministry of Finance and Economy figures showed on Thursday.</p>
<p>					   Aug	July	Aug 95</p>
<p>    PPI (pct, yr-on-yr)	    +2.3     +2.3	+4.6</p>
<p>    PPI (pct, month-to-month)    +0.1     +0.8	+0.1</p>
<p>    PPI (base=1990)		 120.4    120.3     117.7</p>
<p>The ministry said the producer price index (PPI) rose 3.4 percent for the whole of 1995, against 3.9 percent in 1994.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
